        <p class="mt-4">Personal data on the Website is processed by the Controller in accordance with applicable law, in particular with Regulation (EU) 2016/679 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 27 April 2016 (<strong class="text-gray-900">GDPR</strong>) and the Polish Personal Data Protection Act of 10 May 2018.</p>
