        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">3. Purpose, basis, retention period and scope of processing</h2>
        <p>In each case the purpose, legal basis, retention period and scope of personal data processed by the Controller follow from the actions taken by a given Service Recipient or Client on the Website.</p>

        <div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
