        <p class="mt-4">Regardless of cookie settings, the user can block sharing data with Google Analytics using the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout?hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light">browser opt-out add-on</a>.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">Browser settings related to cookies are important from the perspective of consent to their use. Every user can specify the conditions for the use of cookies via their browser settings.</p>
